"\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003eIncluye:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e50 g de Café Molido Blend Gold City\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e50 g de Café Molido Blend Evolve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e50 g de café molido descafeinado\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e50g Café Molido Origen Colombia\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e50g Café Molido Origen Honduras\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"\u003eTómate un buen café\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Blackdrop Coffee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51232918241562,"sku":"RMOL3082","price":22990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0784\/1395\/5354\/files\/pack-5-doypacks-femme-molido-6869469.jpg?v=1778077337"},{"product_id":"caja-iman-nav-2025-25-capsulas-nav","title":"Caja Navidad 25 Cápsulas para Nespresso","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaja iman 25 Cápsulas de café Navidad\u0